      540.73
    ],
    "text": "4. (1) The affairs of the Corporation shall, subject to theprovisions of this Act and the rules of the Corporation, madeunder Section 6, be administered by a Board Directorsconsisting of the Chairman, Secretary, Treasurer and fivemembers elected in accordance with such rules.",
    "fonts": [
